+---
+id: lem-qftx-super-poincare-graded-jacobi
+kind: lemma
+title: Graded Jacobi and real-form verification for the extended super-Poincare algebra
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+domain: mathematics
